@* 카테고리 타일 선택 컴포넌트 — 대분류 먼저, 그 다음 소분류 선택 *@
@inject CategoryService CategorySvc

@if (_parentNames.Count > 0)
{
    @if (_selectedParent == null)
    {
        @* 1단계: 대분류 타일 *@
        <MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle2" Class="mb-2" Color="Color.Secondary">대분류 선택</MudText>
        <div class="tile-grid">
            @foreach (var parent in _parentNames)
            {
                <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                           Class="category-tile"
                           OnClick="() => SelectParent(parent)">
                    @parent
                </MudButton>
            }
        </div>
    }
    else
    {
        @* 2단계: 소분류 타일 *@
        <div class="d-flex align-center mb-2">
            <MudIconButton Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.ArrowBack"
                           Size="Size.Small" OnClick="ClearParent" />
            <MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle2" Color="Color.Primary" Class="ml-1">
                @_selectedParent
            </MudText>
        </div>
        <div class="tile-grid">
            @foreach (var cat in _subCategories)
            {
                var isSelected = SelectedCategoryId == cat.Id;
                <MudButton Variant="@(isSelected ? Variant.Filled : Variant.Outlined)"
                           Color="@(isSelected ? Color.Primary : Color.Default)"
                           Class="category-tile"
                           OnClick="() => SelectCategory(cat)">
                    @cat.Name
                </MudButton>
            }
        </div>
    }
}

<style>
    .tile-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 8px;
    }
    .category-tile {
        height: 52px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        white-space: normal;
        line-height: 1.2;
    }
</style>

@code {
    [Parameter] public int? SelectedCategoryId { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public EventCallback<int> SelectedCategoryIdChanged { get; set; }

    private List<string> _parentNames = [];
    private List<HouseholdBudget.Data.Entities.Category> _subCategories = [];
    private string? _selectedParent;

    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()
    {
        _parentNames = await CategorySvc.GetParentNamesAsync();
    }

    private async Task SelectParent(string parent)
    {
        _selectedParent = parent;
        _subCategories = await CategorySvc.GetByParentAsync(parent);
    }

    private void ClearParent()
    {
        _selectedParent = null;
        _subCategories = [];
    }

    private async Task SelectCategory(HouseholdBudget.Data.Entities.Category cat)
    {
        await SelectedCategoryIdChanged.InvokeAsync(cat.Id);
    }
}
